        },
        {
          "number": 3,
          "step": "Heat a seasoned skillet over medium-high heat and lightly coat the surface with sesame oil."
        },
        {
          "number": 4,
          "step": "Pour half a cup of batter into the hot pan, swirling quickly to form a thin round flatbread crepe."
        },
        {
          "number": 5,
          "step": "Top one side of the flatbread with bean sprouts, cooked mung beans, chopped scallions, and fermented tofu."
        },
        {
